// How many external-IP lookups may be in flight at one time.
//
// MEASURED 2026-10-09, live run of 986 templates against https://yandex.ru: the
// engine issued one lookup per logical exchange, every exchange got its own
// goroutine, and the process held up to 102 simultaneous TLS connections while
